<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-088" chapter-id="c-songshu-088-xueandu" source-id="s-songshu-088-xueandu-ws2069210">
  <p id="c-songshu-088-xueandu:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-088-xueandu:p001:m0000" ref="u3k_51j_4ul_A">薛安都</persName>，河東汾陰人也。世為強族，同姓有三千家。父<persName id="c-songshu-088-xueandu:p001:m0024" ref="u3k_51j_4ul">廣</persName>為宗豪，高祖定關、河，以為上黨太守。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-088-xueandu:p002" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-088-xueandu:p002:m0000" ref="23q_wcp_hny">道固</persName>遣子<persName id="c-songshu-088-xueandu:p002:m0004" ref="23q_wcp_hny_A">景徵</persName>、<persName id="c-songshu-088-xueandu:p002:m0007" ref="kfw_r30_lgz">傅靈越</persName>領眾，並應<persName id="c-songshu-088-xueandu:p002:m0015" ref="u3k_51j_4ul_A">安都</persName>。</p>
</text>
